{"v":4,"catch":"請使用重型機械將豌豆從燒賣上清除。","desc":"「嗨，各位好孩子！我是那位不愛吃青豆的工地監工。」\n\n這份工作是操作重型機械，從燒賣上撿除青豆。\n\n操作重型機械只需使用左右搖桿。\n既要大膽又要謹慎，運用精準的搖桿操作，來幫現場監督解決午餐問題吧！\n\n挖掘機、輪式裝載機、堆高機、起重機。\n針對這四種重型機械，我們準備了超過40種操作技巧。\n掌握所有技巧，朝著成為重型機械達人的目標邁進吧！","publisher":"Wataru Nakano","release":"2026-07-02","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d922024808b6601f60fefd611f867f5735ea291973673471abd9029d7bc89545.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/765bec94560348d93329321bb0299f80eddd683c228cb541ea46e2de74fd90d0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/147a6f031bf0f4fdc3430d69789844a615c59fc34352d09471aec9e2f73a5d74.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8193d1402dabf8b0ef8cfe04aa633f49e8757b2dece8245e776fffbd28fb5d56.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/143b2ca365080a64e816e9ca149d8dfd2ac3e0fa8f0c3aaaa4a35bd76ddfb0d2.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2d20fdb76a3d617aac42a687b9f54a3a60f9b29c2db864b9e7ec16bf5e3b98aa.jpg"],"titleId":"01004de028620000","dlc":[]}